  (text "J1: 1=GND 2=C2D 3=C2CK 4=3V3. TP7/TP8: UART0 for the factory bootloader (C2D low at reset)."
    (at 86.36 73.66 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (face "Arial")
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        italic
        (color 0 0 194 1)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "d1510fbc-31ef-4292-b3ea-6973a7d83af6")
  )
  (text "QFN32: own BEACON pin (P1.7 = PCA CEX0 during a reply), C2D not shared, 9 spares driven low."
    (at 78.74 184.15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (face "Arial")
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        italic
        (color 0 0 194 1)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "84e2881c-26c9-4ce3-9d4b-47eb0acf5e4d")
  )
  (text "P0.0 = VREF (precision 2.4 V, C50). SENSE = P0.2, digital and ADC at once (PRTDRV.COEX)."
    (at 78.74 193.67 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (face "Arial")
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        italic
        (color 0 0 194 1)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "14a6e99a-1994-4cd0-a996-471daf3305ea")
  )
  (text "EP is the only GND pin: solder it, with vias. VDD: 1 uF + 100 nF at the pin (AN203)."
    (at 78.74 187.33 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (face "Arial")
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        italic
        (color 0 0 194 1)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "501490a9-3493-4ef1-80a7-a3e02d722d17")
  )
  (text "SYSCLK = HFOSC0/8 = 3.0625 MHz, Snooze when idle (no clock, no spurs). ILNA RC: fc = 1.6 kHz"
    (at 78.74 190.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (face "Arial")
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        italic
        (color 0 0 194 1)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "6118b706-91e1-414b-8973-6359073ed433")
  )
